This licence covers the code in this repository only.

The ingested corpus is third-party content under its own licences. See
`data/corpus/LICENCES.md` (generated by `scripts/fetch_corpus.py`) for the
per-document licence of every ingested paper, and `docs/corpus.md` for the
corpus selection policy. No corpus documents are committed to this repository.

Model weights downloaded at build time (BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5,
BAAI/bge-reranker-base) are MIT licensed. Ollama models are pulled at runtime
under their own licences — see `docs/corpus.md` for the table.
